<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Star My Repository</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #0d1117;
  color: white;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.card {
  background: #161b22;
  padding: 35px 25px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  width: 280px;
}

.star {
  font-size: 65px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 25px;
}

p {
  color: #c9d1d9;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
  background: #f0c000;
  color: #111;
  border: none;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
  background: #ffd633;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="star">⭐</div>
  <h1>Star My Repository</h1>
  <p>আমার GitHub Repository ভালো লাগলে একটি Star দিয়ে সাপোর্ট করো!</p>

  <button onclick="window.open(
  'https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO',
  '_blank'
  )">
  ⭐ Give a Star
  </button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
